&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AUTOGRIP® introduces its first thin manual chuck, engineered with a focus on lightweight construction and a compact form factor. This new design stands out from traditional manual chucks by offering an expanded Z-axis processing range, which is especially beneficial for complex machining tasks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
